add('twenty-words','base:385','O‘qish va ish mavzusida 20 so‘z: achieve — erishmoq; improve — yaxshilamoq; require — talab qilmoq; benefit — foyda; challenge — qiyinchilik; evidence — dalil; approach — yondashuv; reliable — ishonchli; relevant — aloqador; efficient — tejamli/samarali; outcome — natija; maintain — saqlab turmoq; assess — baholamoq; compare — taqqoslamoq; contribute — hissa qo‘shmoq; available — mavjud; accurate — aniq/to‘g‘ri; responsible — mas’ul; opportunity — imkoniyat; develop — rivojlantirmoq. Daraja alohida ma’noga bog‘liq; bularning barchasiga tekshirilgan B2 tamg‘asi qo‘ymayman. Uchta gap tuzing: We need reliable evidence. This approach saves time. Practice helps us improve.',
 'Twenty useful study/work words: achieve, improve, require, benefit, challenge, evidence, approach, reliable, relevant, efficient, outcome, maintain, assess, compare, contribute, available, accurate, responsible, opportunity, develop. Level depends on the sense; this is not a certified B2 inventory. Try: We need reliable evidence. This approach saves time. Practice helps us improve.')
